# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` and fill in the values to enable booking
# notification emails from `wrangler dev`. `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
#
# For Gmail use port 465 (implicit TLS). An app password is required:
#   https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/185833
#
# For a local SMTP sink during development, point at it and use a plaintext port:
#   SMTP_HOST=127.0.0.1
#   SMTP_PORT=2525
#   SMTP_USER=sender@local.test
#   SMTP_PASSWORD=secret
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=465
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
